                    borrow the visual language of public spaces and translate it
                    into the context of a home. Among the different ideas that
                    emerged, the sofa concept quickly became my favorite so I
                    had to continue developing it. It combined the clarity of
                    urban furniture with the intimacy of domestic comfort in a
                    way that felt both unusual and promising.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <h3
                    class="text-xl font-heading font-semibold mb-3 text-slate-900"
                  >
                    Design Process
                  </h3>
